                <mxCell id="32" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;WHY INVERT?&lt;/b&gt;  Q1 (common-source) naturally flips the signal:&lt;br&gt;GPIO HIGH → Q1 ON → Q2 Gate=0V → Load OFF.&lt;br&gt;Firmware compensates: &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;duty_val = MAX − (N × MAX / 100)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;so set_duty(100) = 💡 Bright and set_duty(0) = ⚫ Off&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2a1040;strokeColor=#9c6fde;fontColor=#ddbbff;fontSize=10;arcSize=10;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
